@startuml
title AI Chat — happy path (as-built): POST /api/v1/chat (SSE, tool-call loop)

actor Partner as U
participant "InsightsScreen\n(frontend-flutter)" as Screen
participant "insights_provider\n(⚠ MOCK today)" as Prov
participant "Router\n(chi + AuthMW)" as Router
participant "chat.Handler\n(handler.go)" as H
participant "AIProviderRegistry\n(OpenAI gpt-4o)" as AI
participant "Registry\n(module__tool)" as Reg
participant "GraphQLExecutor\n(graphql_executor.go)" as GQL
participant "Resolvers\n(schema.resolvers.go)" as Res
database "Repos\n(subs/snapshot/txn)" as Repo

U -> Screen : ask "which stores are at risk?"
note over Prov : TODAY: sendMessage() returns\ncanned _generateResponse() — backend NOT called
Prov -> Router : POST /api/v1/chat  (Firebase token)  [intended path]
Router -> H : HandleChat (auth ctx: user+org)
H -> H : buildSystemPrompt(base + module fragments)
loop up to maxToolIterations = 5
  H -> AI : ChatCompletion(messages + tool defs)
  AI --> H : text and/or tool_calls
  alt tool_calls present
    H -> Reg : route module__tool
    Reg -> GQL : execute GraphQL query(appID, args)
    GQL -> Res : resolve(appID)
    note right of Res : parses appID from ARGS\nno org-ownership check here (DIVERGENCE)
    Res -> Repo : FindByAppID(ctx, appUUID)
    Repo --> Res : rows
    Res --> GQL : data
    GQL --> H : tool_result
    H --> Prov : SSE event {tool_call}, {tool_result}
  else final answer
    H --> Prov : SSE {response} = text + state bundle + suggestions
  end
end
Prov -> Screen : notifyListeners()
Screen --> U : streamed answer

note over H
  Error paths: 405 non-POST · 400 bad body / no messages
  503 AI provider not configured · tool error -> {error,isError} appended, loop continues
end note
@enduml
